     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<br>I have a rather complex shiny app with tabs containing numerous of observers and renderers, and imbricated renderers.<br>I would like to be able to save and restore data in a certain order, as some values depend on other values. The <b>priority</b> argument would have been perfect for what I&#39;m trying to do, but there is no such argument for the renderUI function. I know that I can use uiOutput and outputOptions to control priority, but my imbricated renderUI are not in the output object.<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">output$try </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$test </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(...)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(...)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><br>Therefore, I was thinking about using onFlush(ed) function to record the last flushing time, wait 2 seconds and then restore another tab. Unfortunately, that does not work as it creates an infinite loop. Example:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">request</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      id </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;main&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      uiOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;testUI&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  values </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactiveValues</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">last_flush </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sys</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">time</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  onFlushed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    values$last_flush </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sys</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">time</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> once </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  output$testUI </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;clickButton&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Click here&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> <br>  observe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">values$last_flush</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>Do you have any suggestion on how I could perform what I&#39;m tryin